    "property_title": "Stunning Cliff-Top Beachfront Resort in Initao",
    "short_description": "",
    "description": "Location: Kawayan Cliff Resort, Beside Coral Resort Estates, Initao, Misamis Oriental\r\n\r\nProperty Details:\r\nLot Area: 4,973 sqm (including access road)\r\nTitle Status: Titling Ongoing\r\nSelling Price: ₱75M\r\n\r\nResort Highlights:\r\nPrime Location: Perched on a cliff overlooking the sea with breathtaking views of Mt. Malindang, Misamis Occidental\r\nPrivate Coral & Sand Beach: Gated, fenced, and accessible via steps with handrails and a walkway at beach level. Perfect for swimming and snorkeling at high tide in calm, crystal-clear waters.\r\n\r\nAmenities:\r\n- The Pavilion Function Hall (Capacity: 100 guests)\r\n- Mini Hall (Capacity: 50 guests)\r\n- Day Cottages (6-12 guests each)\r\n- Gazebo Function Hall (Capacity: 40 guests)\r\n- Overnight Cottages\r\n- Multi-Function Building: With restrooms, laundry, storage, and kitchen\r\n\r\nLocation Advantage:\r\nApproximately 200 meters from the CDO-Iligan Highway (H9)\r\nConvenient turnoff opposite the Petron station at Pagahan",
